  "summary": "F-14 is forecast to produce about 322 000 Sm3 of oil in the next 12 months from 2013-01-02 (about 881 Sm3/d at historic uptime), with a calibrated uncertainty band of 247 000 to 360 000 Sm3. The fit on the post-step-down window is poor and essentially flat, so confidence is low and the true outcome is more uncertain than the model's narrow bootstrap band suggests.",
